name: sim.getScriptStringParam
description: Deprecated. Use sim.getObjectStringParam instead
luaSynopsis: bytes parameter = sim.getScriptStringParam(int scriptHandle, int parameterID)
pythonSynopsis: buffer parameter = sim.getScriptStringParam(int scriptHandle, int parameterID)
inputs:
1. scriptHandle: handle of the script. Can be combined with sim.handle_self to target the current script
2. parameterID: identifier of the parameter to retrieve. See the list of all possible script parameters
outputs:
1. parameter: buffer
